WEBVTT

00:10:58.956 --> 00:11:00.156
and we do.

00:11:00.196 --> 00:11:02.916
For any of these new solutions
to work for climate,

00:11:02.916 --> 00:11:05.276
they have to have
at least these two ingredients:

00:11:05.276 --> 00:11:07.276
the technology that scales

00:11:07.276 --> 00:11:10.556
and the relationships
and empathy that we share.

00:11:11.036 --> 00:11:15.476
This is what we'll need to create
a future where our children can thrive.

00:11:16.476 --> 00:11:19.076
And I have a particularly large
stake in that.

00:11:19.116 --> 00:11:20.156
(Laughter)

00:11:20.156 --> 00:11:21.316
Thank you.

00:11:21.356 --> 00:11:28.316
(Cheers and applause)